---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CLARITY_ID, CONTACT_EMAIL, GA4_ID, LAST_UPDATED, LEGAL, SITE_NAMES, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title={`Legal notice – ${SITE_NAMES[lang]}`} description="Publisher, publication director, host, intellectual property, legal texts and official pages quoted, limits of liability and the law governing this website." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Legal notice' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Legal notice</h1>
    <p>Information published under article 6 III-1 of French law no. 2004-575 of 21 June 2004 on confidence in the digital economy (LCEN).</p>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <p>Publication director: {AUTHOR_NAME}, responsible for the content published on {SITE_URL}.</p>
    <h2>Host</h2>
    <LegalIdentity mode="hosting" lang={lang} />
    <h2>Purpose of the site and no advice</h2>
    <p>The site works out free of charge, from the visitor’s inputs, the instalment calendar of the settlements of debts passed to the Italian collection agency (statutory dates, last useful day, estimated amounts), checks the lapse rules, estimates the sums written off and compares an ordinary instalment plan. These results are not tax or legal advice, a decision or personal guidance: only the statement of sums due from Agenzia delle entrate-Riscossione is binding. The site is independent: it is affiliated with neither Agenzia delle entrate-Riscossione, the Agenzia delle entrate, INPS, any region or comune, nor any accountant, tax-assistance centre, law firm or lender, and uses no official logo. Method and limits: <a href={route('method', lang)}>method</a>.</p>
    <h2>Sources quoted</h2>
    <p>Rules: laws and decrees published in the Gazzetta Ufficiale and on Normattiva; legislative and regulatory texts are not covered by copyright (article 5 of Italian law 633 of 1941). How the rules are applied: public FAQs and pages of Agenzia delle entrate-Riscossione, from which the site takes only facts and dates, with a link to the source, without reproducing their texts or lists.</p>
    <h2>Limits of liability</h2>
    <p>Information is reread against the official texts and checked, with no guarantee of being error-free or always current. Instalment amounts are estimates. The publisher cannot be held liable for a decision taken solely on the basis of an amount or date shown here. Errors can be reported through the <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact</a> page.</p>
    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>Text, graphics and code are protected and remain the publisher’s property; short quotations are allowed with a link to the original page. The sources quoted belong to their respective owners.</p>
    <h2>Embedding the tool</h2><p>The instalment calendar can be embedded free as an iframe, keeping the visible link: see the <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed page</a>.</p>
    {/* gen-legal-pages:terms */}
    <h2>Personal data and cookies</h2>
    {GA4_ID ? (<p>What you type in the calculators stays in your browser. The site sets Google Analytics audience measurement cookies (<code>_ga</code>, <code>_ga_{GA4_ID.replace('G-', '')}</code>, 13 months at most), with no advertising{CLARITY_ID && '; page stability is monitored with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free'}. Details, legal basis and how to object: <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>) : (<p>What you type in the calculators stays in your browser and the site sets no cookies{CLARITY_ID && '; page stability is monitored anonymously with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free'}. See the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and the <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>)}
    {/* /gen-legal-pages:terms */}
    <h2>Reporting</h2><p>Unlawful content: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>, with the page address and the reason.</p>
    <h2>Governing law</h2><p>French law, the publisher being established in France. Failing an amicable settlement, the competent courts of {LEGAL.jurisdiction}. Updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
